{# TEXT 3 #}
<div class="oe-text">
  <p>The personas encountered amidst these trying times are adorned with military signifiers, mirroring the somber aspects of adulthood. The acid-colored cartoon elements reference electronic games and American movies, pointing to a forgotten childhood, expressing the loss of innocence and contemplation of its reasons, and attempting to find a trace of a smile amidst the serious military environment.</p>
</div>

